From: Jordan <jordan@adtvmedia.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Apr 2026 16:07:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add middle mouse button trigger, improve STT speed

- Add MouseButtonManager using uiohook-napi for global mouse button
  detection (MiddleMouse, Mouse4, Mouse5)
- Wire mouse button support into HotkeyManager, validator, and display
- Default whisper-server thread count to 75% of CPU cores (capped at 4)
- Raise silence detection threshold from 0.002 to 0.005 for faster cutoff
- Change default Whisper model from 'base' to 'tiny' for faster STT
- Add uiohook-napi dependency to package.json

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
